# NameCraft — AI Name Generator

> Beautiful names with real meaning. Powered by Claude AI.

Live demo target: `https://yourusername.github.io/nameforge`

---

## Deploy in 5 minutes

### 1. Create the GitHub repo

- Name: `nameforge` (or anything you want)
- Visibility: **Public** (required for free GitHub Pages)
- Leave README / .gitignore / license all off
- Click **Create repository**

### 2. Upload files

Upload these files preserving the folder structure:

```
nameforge/
├── index.html
├── css/
│   └── style.css
└── js/
    └── main.js
```

### 3. Enable GitHub Pages

Go to your repo → **Settings** → **Pages** → Source: `main` branch → **Save**

Wait ~60 seconds. Your site is live.

---

## Configuration (3 things to change)

### API Key — `js/main.js` line 9

```js
const API_KEY = 'YOUR_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY';
```

Get your key at [console.anthropic.com](https://console.anthropic.com). New accounts get free credits.

> ⚠️ **Security note:** Putting an API key in frontend JS is fine for testing. For real traffic, proxy it through a [Cloudflare Worker](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/) (free tier is generous).

### Payment email — `index.html`

Search for `hello@namecraft.io` and replace with your PayPal / Venmo address. It appears in 2 places.

### Price (optional) — `index.html`

Search `$7.99` and `$24.99` to change pricing. The psychology: anchor high ($24.99 crossed out), sell low ($7.99). Sweet spot for impulse buys.

---

## How the monetization works

| Stage | What happens |
|---|---|
| **Free hook** | User gets 3 names — enough to get excited, not enough to stop |
| **Sunk cost** | They've already typed their preferences. Leaving feels wasteful |
| **Anchor pricing** | $24.99 crossed out → $7.99 feels like a steal |
| **Risk reversal** | 7-day money-back removes the last objection |
| **Manual fulfillment** | They email payment screenshot → you send PDF within 5 min |

**Target:** 5 sales/day × $7.99 = ~$1,450/month on autopilot

---

## The PDF report (what you're selling)

When someone pays, generate their full report using the Claude API with a longer prompt requesting 10 names + deep analysis. Format it in Canva, Google Docs, or Notion and export as PDF. Template takes ~15 min to build, then each report takes ~3 min to send.

Or automate it: use Make (formerly Integromat) to trigger on payment confirmation email → call Claude API → generate PDF → email it back. Zero manual work.

---

## Traffic / marketing

The fastest channels for this niche:

| Channel | Tactic |
|---|---|
| **Reddit** | Post to r/namenerds, r/Dognames, r/startups — genuine answers, mention the tool |
| **Pinterest** | Pin aesthetic name cards. Baby/pet name content gets enormous organic traffic |
| **TikTok** | "I used AI to generate a name for my daughter" — 30s screen recording, no face needed |
| **Facebook Groups** | Baby name groups have hundreds of thousands of members |
| **Product Hunt** | Launch on a Tuesday morning for maximum upvotes |

---

## Upgrade path (scale to $5k/month)

1. **Stripe integration** — replace manual PayPal with [Stripe Payment Links](https://stripe.com/payment-links). No code needed.
2. **Webhook automation** — on successful payment, auto-generate PDF and email it using [Resend](https://resend.com) + Claude API.
3. **Upsell** — add a $19 "Astrology compatibility" add-on after purchase.
4. **SEO content** — build `/names/girl/celtic`, `/names/boy/nordic` pages. Baby name SEO traffic is enormous.

